From: Vylen Linux Team
Date: 2026-10-08 22:53:24 +02:00
Subject: [PATCH] gst-libav: fix build with FFmpeg 9 codec IDs

FFmpeg 9 no longer exposes AV_CODEC_ID_V308, AV_CODEC_ID_V408 and
AV_CODEC_ID_V410. gst-libav only uses these IDs to skip the corresponding
raw-video codecs during registration, so remove those checks while keeping
AV_CODEC_ID_R210.

--- a/ext/libav/gstavvidenc.c
+++ b/ext/libav/gstavvidenc.c
@@ -1036,3 +1036 @@
-        in_plugin->id == AV_CODEC_ID_V308 ||
-        in_plugin->id == AV_CODEC_ID_V408 ||
-        in_plugin->id == AV_CODEC_ID_V410 || in_plugin->id == AV_CODEC_ID_R210
+        in_plugin->id == AV_CODEC_ID_R210
--- a/ext/libav/gstavviddec.c
+++ b/ext/libav/gstavviddec.c
@@ -3003,3 +3003 @@
-        in_plugin->id == AV_CODEC_ID_V308 ||
-        in_plugin->id == AV_CODEC_ID_V408 ||
-        in_plugin->id == AV_CODEC_ID_V410 || in_plugin->id == AV_CODEC_ID_R210
+        in_plugin->id == AV_CODEC_ID_R210
